      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A convenient strategy for the synthesis of sulfur ylides via rhodium-catalyzed coupling of in situ generated iodonium ylides with sulfides or sulfoxides has been developed. A wide range of sulfur ylides were obtained in moderate to good yields from inexpensive sulfur compounds and active methylene compounds with a short reaction time (MW, 5-10 min) or 12-16 h at rt. Furthermore, these sulfoxonium ylides were used as novel acceptor/acceptor carbenes for N-H insertion reactions."},
